---

<section class="quickstart" id="quickstart">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <p class="label">Quickstart</p>
      <h2>Up and running in two minutes</h2>
      <p class="desc">Install the CLI, start the server, connect your phone.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <h3>Install</h3>
        </div>
        <p>One-line installer for macOS & Linux:</p>
        <pre>curl -fsSL https://crystal-lattice-downloads-874087778966.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/crystal-lattice-cli/install.sh | bash</pre>
        <p>Or via pipx:</p>
        <pre>pipx install crystal-lattice-cli</pre>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <h3>Start the server</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Create a working directory and launch:</p>
        <pre>{`mkdir ~/crystal-lattice && cd ~/crystal-lattice

crystal-lattice \\
  --server \\
  --console \\
  --config-local \\
  --host 0.0.0.0 \\
  --port 9000`}</pre>
        <p>Add a provider key to <code>.crystal/config.json</code> to enable model calls.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-header">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <h3>Connect your phone</h3>
        </div>
        <p>Find your LAN IP:</p>
        <pre>{`hostname -I              # Linux
ipconfig getifaddr en0   # macOS`}</pre>
        <p>In the app: <strong>Manual Address → &lt;IP&gt;:9000 → Connect</strong></p>
        <p>Or launch with <code>--enable-bonjour</code> for zero-config auto-discovery.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .quickstart {
    padding: 5.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .header {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .header h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3.5vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }

  .desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-4);
  }

  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .step {
    background: var(--bg-raised);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .step-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    background: var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step h3 {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .step p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-4);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .step strong {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .step pre {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.875rem;
  }

</style>
